WEBVTT

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.730
Master Danblf...

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.310
I wonder how he is doing right now.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.610
I feel kind of nervous.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.150
All right, Cleos. Light.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.700
As you wish.

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:43.540
Wow! It's so bright!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.380
The desks and stuff are falling apart,

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.050
but the books and other
materials still look so neat.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.050
Must be the preservation
and antitheft spells.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:02.100
This place functions as a dungeon,
but it was originally an archive.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.730
They look to be clustered up ahead.

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.780
All nothing but small fry.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.790
What say we give them a quick
drubbing and be on our way.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.700
Um! Would you mind taking
a look at my evocation magic?

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.620
"Episode 8
'I Am Danblf'"

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.620
Um! Would you mind taking
a look at my evocation magic?

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.670
"Episode 8
'I Am Danblf'"

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.670
I'd like to take this rare opportunity
to get your feedback.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.500
I'll probably never get
a chance like this again.

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.760
Well, that should be fine.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.090
Thank you very much!

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.140
Then...

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.810
Please observe my top summon!

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:48.440
Oh-ho, a salamander.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.310
It has quite the fierce look.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.730
It does, right?! I just can't get over
how stout and heavy it is!

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.700
This shape! And its eyes!
They're so big and round and cute!

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:59.700
Its scales are a nice hue, too, and...

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.740
A-And here we... Here we go!

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:11.670
Ooh!

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:16.720
That was perfect! You did so good!

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.180
H-How did my little one do?

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.680
The Fire Breath was quite impressive.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:24.390
It should be more than effective
at high levels as well.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:29.140
However, the sluggishness of
its movements is a bit concerning.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:32.400
It think it would be good
if you train up its mobility.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.780
Indeed. Salamanders are weak
when it comes to defense.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.530
Mm-hm, that's good to know.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:41.950
All right. Once we get home,
it's training for you.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.660
--But that was really good!
You did so well!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.080
--They are practically
like mother and child.
--But that was really good!
You did so well!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.460
--Yes, having a parental relationship
with one's summons
--But that was really good!
You did so well!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.580
--Yes, having a parental relationship
with one's summons
--There, there.
There, there! Yup, yup!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:53.340
--is a common thing with summoners.
--There, there.
There, there! Yup, yup!

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.100
There are so many of them here as well.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:09.980
I know. Cleos, will you not show
us your salamander this time?

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:12.690
It might also serve as
an example for Ms. Hinata.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.150
An example, you say?

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.940
Yes! I would love to see it!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.110
I understand. Please leave it to me.

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:22.950
Come forth, salamander!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.210
It looks totally different than mine!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.120
Well, then, here we go.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:43.760
Wow, it's so fast.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:47.350
Cleos's salamander is geared
towards mobility, after all.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:50.680
Depending on how you raise yours,
anything is possible.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:55.360
R-Right! I have to make sure
I develop my little one's strengths!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.270
Rather than be daunted by
their difference in ability,

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:59.940
she harbors hopes for what can be.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:04.160
That is more promising than anything.
I cannot wait to see what is to come.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.200
Now, go on home.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.500
I saw some decent growth there.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.460
Thank you very much.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.290
That's what she calls "decent"?

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:22.840
Hmm, it says to place
the firefly glowstone here.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.930
That's easy to understand.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:33.730
Ooh! This certainly feels
like the real deal.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.770
Ooh!

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:36.270
--Wow!

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:39.730
--Miss Mira. Ms. Hinata. Behind you.
--Wow!

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:40.650
I fell for it!

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.320
That makes no sense!

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.280
I don't understand it, either.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.540
They look ready to come
to life at any minute.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.250
It is as you surmise.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.630
First, the knight statue
with the sword will move.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:06.800
Then, the warrior statue holding
the halberd will begin to move.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.760
Mm, as I thought.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:11.720
First-time foes get my heart racing.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:15.230
This is a rare match for me.
Stay out of it.

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:16.900
I am well aware.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.020
Mira sounds like she's having fun.

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:23.150
Ms. Hinata, please watch carefully
as Miss Mira fights.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:27.070
It should show you a glimpse of
the pinnacle of evocation magic.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:29.660
I-I understand!

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:33.870
Now, then, my opponents
appear to be golems, but...

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.470
Th-That's a salamander?!

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.510
Ah! It brings back memories!

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.930
That's as good as a wingless dragon!

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:57.640
Miss Mira's salamander makes the air
expand with heat and flames,

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:02.110
flies even without wings,
and has full control of flames.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.320
A-Amazing.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:13.580
You finished off the knight statue before
the warrior statue started to move.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.620
Mm, excellent work.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.920
I expected no less of you.
It was most educational.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:26.460
This is... the pinnacle
of evocation magic...

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.880
Come, we are headed for the final area.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.390
R-Right!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:48.490
We have to find it among all these?
It will be no easy task.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:51.660
That reminds me, you're here
in search of information, correct?

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.370
What sort of material...?

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:54.410
This.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:58.830
Relating to the plant life in the
southern part of the continent, is it?

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.670
In that case, that'll be in Section 6.

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:05.500
What in hell is this?! Why is there
such a thing in a dungeon?!

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:09.760
This place was once used as a museum.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.930
I see. So this is a relic from back then.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:17.180
But as I feared,
it is farthest in the back.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:19.890
In that case, I think
it will be faster to fly.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.140
You mustn't!

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:25.020
If you stray from the fixed route or
separate books from their shelves,

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:26.650
it will trigger the antitheft mechanisms!

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:29.070
It will spawn countless golems
and defensive walls,

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.610
and we will be in big trouble!

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.660
A-All right. We will walk.

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.100
Yet another gimmick
trying to look enticing.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.300
This is...

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.220
One of those, right?

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.020
Where you go click-click-click and
make surfaces of the same color.

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:01.690
Yes, you're right.

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:06.020
It is not that I cannot do these, but...
they take time, do they not?

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:10.070
Yes. I could as well,
if given about six hours...

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:13.910
Five by five is a little...
Even three by three is tough for me.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.240
Even as acting Wise Man, this is hard...

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.950
Um...

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.620
I solved the puzzle.

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.830
What?!

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.710
Puzzles are a forte of mine.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:25.920
You are incredible!

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.630
What a talent!

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:32.920
The truth is, I had so much time
during my evocation magic class,

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:34.970
I spent it all doing puzzles.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:37.760
That's hard to feel happy about.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:43.810
When I came exploring last time,
I got this far, but...

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.060
So, this is in the ancient
spirit language.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:48.770
A tough one, even for me.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:52.110
Even for Master Suleiman,
who has a grasp of all spirit languages,

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.780
it was indecipherable.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.740
I know!

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.330
The stareater, who gazes up at the sky,

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:03.830
carries a bow that takes on
the colors of the setting sun,

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.500
and, notching bolts of lightning,
unleashes them into the void.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.920
Round and round,
shooting at constellations

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.130
brings the forgotten souls
of fallen heroes

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:13.260
down from the far reaches
of the heavens into dreams

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:15.630
and they depart the cycle
of rebirth to doze to the rain.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:18.090
That is the cold azure faraway vision

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:20.310
that remains of the sky in
the memories of the ghosts,

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:24.980
who sleep in Akasha's cage in
the distant crevices of this world.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.100
Here and now, in this star-filled world,

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.730
let the history spun
fall into these hands.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.980
Master!

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:35.950
Ah, Pam. It has been a long time.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.700
I request an embrace!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:41.330
There, there! Good girl! Good girl!

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:47.620
Sh-She used all that mana on this
summon and it's this little girl?

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:50.790
Lady Pam is a rainbow spirit
from the distant past,

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:55.130
who retains all her knowledge
as she is reborn again and again.

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:56.880
Wow.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:01.140
So, Pam, can you read what it says here?

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:02.430
Let's see.

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.810
It looks like it tells you how
to disarm this thing.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:09.350
There are ten stone statues here,

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.480
and it says to turn them
left or right, in order.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.530
You are a clever girl, Pam.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:17.490
Then, might I ask you
to read off the order?

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:19.410
Of course!

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:23.120
First, turn the black four-legged
beast to the right.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.740
Roger that.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:28.210
The second one is the white
four-legged beast.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.040
Got it.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.590
Last one is, turn the
black orb to the left.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:33.800
Mm.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.420
Heave-ho.

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:42.010
We did it!

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.640
You were a great help, Pam!

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:45.970
Thank you for your hard work.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:50.440
No! I don't wanna go straight back home!

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.570
There, there. You are such a baby, Pam.

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:58.900
I am glad for you, Lady Pam.
I understand how you feel.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.780
What? Don't tell me...

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:03.490
Master Cleos likes to be a baby, too?

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:06.700
Um, I think that's great.

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:14.000
Now, then, we need to
take back the material here.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.760
Oh, but if we remove them, the traps...

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:20.840
We use these.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:24.510
This paper can copy over writing
just by pressing it against it.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:26.770
Oh, copy paper!

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:30.520
Then, let us split up and get to work.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.150
Master!

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:34.940
Play with me! Please, play with me!

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:38.150
Ah, be a good girl and wait a while.

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:41.200
Hmm... Can I go play?

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:44.280
Mm, do not go too far.

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:46.030
I consent.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.880
We finally finished copying.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:00.510
Master!

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:03.720
I request a recitation of this text!

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.890
Hm? You wish me to read?

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:10.140
Pam! Where did you get that?!

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:11.690
Over there!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.810
You are such a troublesome child!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.490
Wow! It's like I'm flying!

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:26.160
There you go! Up, up, and away!

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:27.580
Miss Mira!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.120
Miss Mira, your hand!

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.080
Oh!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.420
The text!

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:41.630
I see. We triggered the spell on the book
keeping it from being removed.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:46.010
We had already finished copying the
material we needed, so that was good.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.680
All right. That means
our mission is complete.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.220
Yes! This was most educational!

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.310
I will continue to work hard
on my evocation magic!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.350
Mm, that is the spirit!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.270
She solved that gimmick in no time?

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:02.530
That Ms. Hinata sure has
some unexpected talents.

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:04.530
It certainly was a big help.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:07.370
Thanks to her,
we were able to return early.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.370
Then, I'll take the material
off your hands.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:12.500
Mm, please take care of it.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:16.290
By the way, I heard you revealed
your identity to Cleos?

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:19.840
Y-Yes, it was an inadvertent slip.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:22.210
If he found out,
I guess it can't be helped.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:27.050
But in that case, isn't there someone
who's been waiting for you even more?

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:30.850
You know, don't you?

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:34.310
She came here solely to be
your assistant, so to her...

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:40.570
The next trip I'll be asking you
to go on is likely to be a bit long,

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:43.780
so if it bothers you, now's the time.

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:46.320
I swear! He has always been so...

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:50.030
Even I know that much!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:53.950
This far out, it should be safe
to summon that one.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:10.100
Long time no see, Eisenfald.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:16.430
Father, when did you become Mother?

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:20.060
It is a long story.
Would you mind not going there?

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:24.610
Fath-- Mother, if you insist,
I will not press.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:27.240
And I am joyous to gain a mother.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:28.740
I-Is that so?

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:32.410
So, Eisenfald, have you been well?

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:35.750
Yes, I was heartbroken
not to be able to see you.

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:38.040
I feared that you had forgotten me.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.290
I-I am sorry about that.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:43.250
Were you alone for a long time as well?

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:47.010
No, I live with my fellow dragons
in the City of Dragons.

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:49.380
I had no idea such a thing exists now.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:50.390
Yes.

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:53.810
Oh, yes. Would this be better?

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:57.310
I learned this from a certain human woman.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:14:59.940
Wh-What is this?

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:03.150
A-Are you Eisenfald?

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.900
Yes, Mother.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.320
I believe this form will better allow me

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:09.900
to feel your love with my whole being.

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:13.280
This world is still full of mysteries.

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:16.040
Hey, that is too close!
At least hide your front!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:20.170
But Mother, when I think of
how it has been 30 years...

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.920
Thirty years...

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:25.460
You had fellow dragons, but that one...

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:34.470
The other day, I rode Cleos's Garuda,
but that was unexpectedly fun.

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:37.520
It is like a dream to be able to fly
with you riding me, Mother.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:38.930
Here we go!

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:43.440
Are you comfortable on board?

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.270
Oh?

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:46.690
What in the--?!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:01.790
Um...

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:03.580
Hm? What is it?

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:05.920
Will you summon me again?

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.420
Of course.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:16.430
I cannot keep putting this off forever.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:21.560
I cannot continue to lie to the one
who is closest and most loyal to me.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.560
Oh.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:28.270
Miss Mira, welcome back.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.780
Is something the matter?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.830
Uh, no, it is nothing.

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:42.290
Th-This is making me
feel rather flustered.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:45.920
I-I am a bit parched. Some tea, please.

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:47.130
Certainly.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:56.890
Mm, that is the Mariana I know.
You know my preferences well.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:02.140
That's because you and Master Danblf
share the same preferences.

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:05.230
Mm, I suppose so.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.560
So, well...

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.900
About Danblf...

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:13.650
The truth is, I--

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:14.900
I know.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:17.910
Huh? What? You do?

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:21.450
When did she find out?
Could Cleos have...?

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:26.460
Yes, I know that in truth,
Master Danblf likes waffles.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.000
--And he loves them with plenty
of whipped cream on top.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:31.630
--Y-Yes! That is right!
--And he loves them with plenty
of whipped cream on top.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:34.010
He looks like a man of such gravitas,

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:37.800
but his tastes are so juvenile.
It makes me laugh!

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.390
That gave me a scare.
So, that was what she meant.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:42.220
That was not good for my heart.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.140
Since we're on the subject, would
you like some, too, Miss Mira?

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.900
M-Mm.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.980
There you are. Please enjoy.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.690
M-Mm.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:56.820
Before I do, there is
something I must tell you.

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:58.570
What is it?

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.330
Well...

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.990
The truth is, I...

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:03.240
I know!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.580
You mean that.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:08.330
Honestly! To think you even have that
in common with Master Danblf...

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:14.260
Master Danblf actually has quite a
hard time with hot foods, doesn't he?

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:15.550
That is right!

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:19.180
My master and I often found ourselves
blowing on each other's food.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:22.470
I'm a bit envious of that.

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:26.730
I am utterly failing to find the right
time to tell her. What do I do?

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:29.650
Um, please excuse me for a moment.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:31.900
There's something I'd like you to look at.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:36.030
I'm still in the process
of making them, but...

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:40.370
I was thinking to make matching
outfits for you and Master Danblf.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:43.490
I'm sure you know, but once Master Danblf
takes a liking to an outfit,

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.750
he tends to wear it for a long time.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:50.420
I believe I've made this
to suit his preferences,

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:53.040
but I wanted to check
with you as well, Miss Mira.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.380
I see. I think it looks good.

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:57.720
At the very least, I like it.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.720
Thank you very much.

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:02.850
Of course, I didn't make them
exactly the same.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:09.640
For you, Miss Mira, I tried putting...
a small ribbon... here...

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:11.230
Mariana?

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:13.440
P-Please pardon me.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:17.650
I hope that Master Danblf
will be returning soon, but...

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.360
That is enough.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:23.490
You need only make the one outfit for me.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:25.870
Why is that?

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:29.710
I am not Danblf's pupil.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:32.500
I am Danblf himself.

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:38.590
What? Oh, I understand. I'll go
prepare another cup of tea for you.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.590
This is not a joke!

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:43.970
I am Danblf!

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:47.220
You are? Really?

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:50.390
Due to circumstances,
right now, this is how I look.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:54.360
The name "Mira" is an alias
made to suit this appearance.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.980
I wanted to let you know the truth.

00:19:57.980 --> 00:19:59.400
But...

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:02.410
Do you have anything to offer as proof?

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:07.080
Let me think. Proof... Proof, is it?

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.540
I know! The Fairy's Grace.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.790
Oh...

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:14.040
The Fairy's Grace is a covenant that
fairies, such as yourself, enter into

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:18.130
with someone they deem
worthy of devoting their life to.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:20.840
You and I have already done so.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:25.350
If that Grace could be renewed,
would that not serve as proof?

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:28.850
Y-Yes, all right.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:54.330
It has been... renewed...

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.880
How about it? Do you believe me now...

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:01.590
At last... At last, I have found you.

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:08.600
I am sorry.

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.520
Looking like this, I did not
know what to tell you.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:16.440
You're terrible! You are you,
no matter what you look like!

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:20.030
It wouldn't change the fact
that I will serve you for life!

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:24.240
It is all right. I am here.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:26.200
Master Danblf.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:30.490
No, while I look like this,
you may call me Mira.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:34.290
Yes, Mast-- Miss Mira.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:42.260
I am, unsurprisingly, exhausted.
I think I will turn in early today.

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:45.130
Mariana was so happy.

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:47.680
Miss Mira.

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:49.300
Y-Yes?

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:50.890
Are you going to sleep already?

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:54.140
I-I suppose I am. Is something the matter?

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:56.350
Pardon me for disturbing your evening.

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:59.770
I came hoping to share
your bed, Miss Mira.

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:01.400
Wh-What?!

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:05.900
I was surprised by
your appearance at first.

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:08.320
Truth be told, so was I.

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:11.580
But thanks to the way you look right now,

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:14.580
I'm able to sleep side-by-side
with you like this.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:18.500
That is true. Right now, I am a girl.

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.790
I apologize for asking
this indulgence of you.

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:25.010
But you'll be leaving to
travel again, won't you?

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:26.170
Forgive me.

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:27.840
There's nothing to forgive.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:31.510
But I haven't seen you in 30 years.

00:22:31.510 --> 00:22:34.850
I wanted to be closer to your heart in
whatever small way I could

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.270
and my desire to share this time
with you overwhelmed me.

00:22:39.270 --> 00:22:41.020
I do not mind.

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:44.650
Though you may be overwhelmed,
I will be there for you, every time.

00:22:45.820 --> 00:22:47.320
Miss Mira...

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:56.450
Miss Mira, good night.

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.960
Mm, good night, Mariana.
